      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "バリケードがところどころ破壊されてますが……\nもしかして、いやらしい症候群が蔓延した時のものでしょうか？",
      "jp_sha256": "a6b74d5dd191145005152a7c74f91caf7ef0ccdcffe9fee20c8bd52d5e254305",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "바리케이드가 군데군데 부서져 있는데……\n혹시 야릇한 증후군이 퍼졌을 때 생긴 건가요?",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 11,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "9dffd9f0d3c040664d1e15f0732e649a564e7af13d03b9e76f5de6988d64170f:000000_-7034085962498180102:g0:r10",
      "row_index_0based": 10,
      "serialized_row_index": 10,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "バリケードがところどころ破壊されてますが……\nもしかして、いやらしい症候群が蔓延した時のものでしょうか？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "93e8a1a62061b95e0ae4d66b4766c2d3e899fbb68939e8c48404ce559a6dc72c",
